{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415344","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415344","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041534401:1":{"text":"よい冬祭りを、ブルータス様！今年は何か予定はあるのですか？","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人！隆冬节快乐！今年节日您有什么安排吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335B8597B9663AD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041534402:1":{"text":"予定か……いつも通り、戦神峰の儀式の主催を行う。","source_cn":"安排……就是一如既往的，会主持战神峰的仪式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6693CCB6A045A134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041534403:1":{"text":"冬祭りは各部族で集まって祝う日だからな。お前たちウール族の準備はどうだ？","source_cn":"毕竟隆冬节都是各部族团聚的日子嘛，你们乌尔氏族准备的怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA02EA69EDA972048","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041534404:1":{"text":"今年はすっっっごいご馳走を用意したんですよ！それに、盛大なダンスパーティーも開く予定です！","source_cn":"今年我们会准备超级、无敌、顶级大餐！还要举行盛大的舞会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2A940A71F33B561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041534405:1":{"text":"コンセプトは――ババリアの毛皮と情熱は、どんな北風にも負けない！さあ、踊ろう！です！","source_cn":"深冬的北风也无法撼动蛮血的皮毛与热血！跳舞吧，朋友们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE00A4EC11AD755DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041534406:1":{"text":"はははっ、いいじゃないか。我が宣伝を手伝おうか？","source_cn":"哈哈哈，棒极了，需要我帮你们宣传一下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94BC7E1E3979E0A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041534407:1":{"text":"宣伝はマンカラさんにお願いしました！でも、ブルータス様にもお願いしたいことが……","source_cn":"不，宣传的事我已经拜托曼卡拉啦，想拜托布鲁特斯大人的是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8873BB756480B672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041534408:1":{"text":"よければ、ダンスパーティーに来てくれませんか？大勢の人があなたと踊りたがっているんです！","source_cn":"今年的舞会，您能不能来参加？不知道有多少人想和您共舞呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DCDC6E29CD2B2B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041534409:1":{"text":"大剣を振り回して回転する姿に、みんなが見惚れること間違いなしです！","source_cn":"您拿着剑转圈的华丽英姿，绝对能折服许多人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7645E2DF864665BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041534410:1":{"text":"それは、ダンスではないのだがな……","source_cn":"那可不是跳舞啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF66A92AC0B17B091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"アルサ","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"ブルータス","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}